cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Resurgence.jl: Borel summation, transseries and alien calculus in Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for the analysis of divergent asymptotic series: exact Borel transforms,
  Padé and AAA approximation of the Borel function, Borel-Padé-Laplace summation with lateral
  sums and Stokes discontinuities, large-order analysis, hyperasymptotics, one- and
  multi-parameter transseries with resonance, and alien calculus.
type: software
